+// AvieBoter patch: the bot's inventory for the app - browse folders, search, see what is worn, and act on items and
+// folders like a viewer's inventory window (add / wear / take off, rez, give, rename, move, new folder, Trash, read
+// notecards). Answers are JSON for the app's Inventory section.
